WEBVTT

01:29.390 --> 01:34.450
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.710 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 5]

01:38.060 --> 01:40.520
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

01:38.200 --> 01:38.920
Really?

01:38.920 --> 01:40.720
So this big treasure is mine now?

01:41.759 --> 01:42.560
Anyway, I'm going abroad,

01:42.560 --> 01:44.020
and I can't take it with me.

01:44.789 --> 01:46.710
You have to treat it well from now on.

01:46.710 --> 01:47.430
Don't worry.

01:47.430 --> 01:49.229
I absolutely won't mistreat it.

01:50.710 --> 01:52.039
There's one more thing.

01:52.150 --> 01:53.840
Do me a favor when you have time.

01:53.840 --> 01:56.500
Regarding that batch of fish
in the school pool,

01:56.550 --> 01:58.090
please deliver them with the tank
to someone for me.

01:58.090 --> 01:59.700
That isn't a problem at all. To whom?

01:59.700 --> 02:00.230
Zhou Wan.

02:02.600 --> 02:03.240
Zhou Wan?

02:03.510 --> 02:04.650
But I'm not close to her.

02:04.650 --> 02:06.040
Aren't you close to Gu Meng?

02:06.040 --> 02:06.710
Bro.

02:08.550 --> 02:09.440
Since when?

02:09.460 --> 02:10.330
Why didn't I know?

02:10.330 --> 02:11.430
What do you mean by since when?

02:11.430 --> 02:13.150
You didn't wear your school uniform
at the school gate,

02:13.150 --> 02:14.360
and your name was recorded by her
more than 50 times.

02:14.360 --> 02:16.490
How can you say you're not close to her?

02:17.030 --> 02:18.160
I-If you put it that way,

02:18.160 --> 02:19.160
I'll give it a try.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.650
Take good care of it.

02:24.850 --> 02:25.600
Don't worry.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.140
Jiang Fan asked me out?

02:31.579 --> 02:32.260
Yeah.

02:32.280 --> 02:33.880
He was being all mysterious.

02:34.030 --> 02:35.160
What does that mean?

02:35.620 --> 02:36.750
Why did he ask me out?

02:37.520 --> 02:38.280
He said

02:38.280 --> 02:40.210
he wanted to give something to you.

02:48.200 --> 02:49.480
Just go, Wan.

02:49.510 --> 02:51.440
I've already promised to help him.

02:52.110 --> 02:52.829
Never mind.

02:53.320 --> 02:54.280
I happen to have something

02:54.280 --> 02:56.130
which I want Jiang Fan to deliver for me.

02:56.130 --> 02:57.490
Did he say where we should meet?

02:57.490 --> 02:59.140
Yes, let me check.

03:02.080 --> 03:04.220
I found it. I'll send it to you.

03:29.510 --> 03:30.000
Hello?

03:30.990 --> 03:31.690
Xixiao.

03:32.120 --> 03:33.920
Why is this fish tank still here?

03:34.560 --> 03:35.820
Where else should it be?

03:35.820 --> 03:36.840
Didn't I tell you to find time

03:36.840 --> 03:38.640
to move it and give it to Zhou Wan?

03:39.190 --> 03:40.240
D-Didn't you want Zhou Wan

03:40.240 --> 03:41.000
to move it directly?

03:41.000 --> 03:41.470
I...

03:43.670 --> 03:44.240
Alright. Seriously,

03:44.240 --> 03:45.310
I have nothing to say to you.

03:45.310 --> 03:47.570
Just come and move it away quickly. Okay?

04:12.970 --> 04:13.900
Why are you here?

04:18.870 --> 04:21.079
Jiang Fan asked me to come here.

04:21.709 --> 04:23.970
He said he wanted to
give something to me.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.470
I didn't know you were here.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.740
Do you usually live here?

04:37.820 --> 04:39.880
Where I live is none of your business.

04:46.130 --> 04:46.790
Never mind.

04:47.830 --> 04:49.560
There was a miscommunication.

04:58.740 --> 04:59.490
It's fine.

04:59.730 --> 05:01.660
I actually have something for you.

05:05.130 --> 05:06.720
I've washed your coat.

05:07.510 --> 05:08.070
Last time,

05:08.070 --> 05:09.950
I didn't know you would come to school,

05:09.950 --> 05:12.390
so I didn't get a chance
to return it to you.

05:14.780 --> 05:15.430
Thank you.

05:20.970 --> 05:22.000
I heard you helped me cover up

05:22.000 --> 05:22.820
my plan of going abroad

05:22.820 --> 05:24.220
in front of the director.

05:26.050 --> 05:27.170
We're even now.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.230
Xixiao.

05:34.960 --> 05:36.540
I'm sorry. Okay?

05:36.950 --> 05:38.150
What's more, well...

05:38.710 --> 05:40.390
You shouldn't hit a smiling person.

05:40.390 --> 05:41.920
You didn't make it clear back then.

05:41.920 --> 05:44.580
-It's not entirely my fault, right?
-I told you.

05:45.159 --> 05:46.360
Ms. Zhou is here, too.

05:46.570 --> 05:47.500
This is perfect.

05:47.560 --> 05:48.390
Come on.

05:49.030 --> 05:50.760
Since you two are both here,

05:50.780 --> 05:52.510
let's get this straight. Okay?

05:52.610 --> 05:54.470
By talking face-to-face,
there won't be any misunderstandings.

05:54.470 --> 05:55.100
Alright?

05:55.520 --> 05:57.050
Come on. Please have a seat.

05:57.600 --> 05:58.630
Now we can hear

05:58.630 --> 05:59.560
your opinions

05:59.560 --> 06:00.430
regarding the custody

06:00.430 --> 06:02.190
of this fish tank.

06:02.330 --> 06:03.490
Who wants to start first?

06:03.490 --> 06:04.920
Didn't I tell you to find time

06:04.920 --> 06:05.720
to move

06:05.720 --> 06:08.040
this fish tank and give it to Zhou Wan?

06:08.060 --> 06:11.140
I misunderstood what you said.

06:12.100 --> 06:13.360
This fish tank is so big

06:13.490 --> 06:14.940
that I don't have room for it in my house.

06:14.940 --> 06:15.680
Since this fish tank is so big,

06:15.680 --> 06:18.140
how can I take it with me
while taking a plane?

06:19.450 --> 06:22.130
That's right.
It's not allowed to take it to a plane.

06:22.130 --> 06:23.540
We saved these fish together.

06:23.540 --> 06:24.190
Logically speaking,

06:24.190 --> 06:25.730
we should each
take half the responsibility.

06:25.730 --> 06:26.870
But there's only this one tank,

06:26.870 --> 06:27.720
and it's too late

06:27.720 --> 06:28.780
to buy a new one now.

06:30.210 --> 06:31.250
Then what should we do?

06:31.250 --> 06:32.510
Then what should we do?

06:34.570 --> 06:36.370
How about we put it in your house?

06:36.670 --> 06:37.740
In my house?

06:38.370 --> 06:38.960
I agree.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.170
I agree, too.

06:44.220 --> 06:44.659
I...

06:49.630 --> 06:50.240
Well...

06:53.740 --> 06:54.980
My house?

06:56.980 --> 06:58.390
Today is the first day of the 2016

06:58.390 --> 07:00.240
national college entrance exam.

07:00.240 --> 07:02.000
To create a safe, quiet and smooth

07:02.000 --> 07:03.830
exam environment

07:03.830 --> 07:04.960
for all candidates,

07:05.430 --> 07:06.630
here's a friendly reminder from

07:06.630 --> 07:08.010
the Pingchuan Public Security Bureau

07:08.010 --> 07:09.920
and the Traffic Police Detachment.

07:09.920 --> 07:12.360
Candidates,
please check in advance whether you've

07:12.360 --> 07:14.090
brought your admission tickets,

07:14.090 --> 07:15.970
ID cards and stationery.

07:16.380 --> 07:18.690
In case of traffic jams or emergencies,

07:18.710 --> 07:20.510
please call 122 immediately

07:20.640 --> 07:23.270
or seek help
from on-duty police officers on the roads.

07:23.270 --> 07:24.190
We will provide

07:24.190 --> 07:25.790
emergency escort services.

07:35.900 --> 07:36.630
Do you need to bring

07:36.630 --> 07:37.920
a few more pencils?

07:38.680 --> 07:39.450
No need.

07:39.550 --> 07:43.010
The first test only
has over 10 fill-in-the-blank questions.

07:43.800 --> 07:44.460
Here.

07:44.530 --> 07:46.430
It's not allowed
to take these things, either.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.480
Are you wearing your watch?

07:47.480 --> 07:48.850
You'll need it to check the time.

07:48.850 --> 07:50.070
It's not allowed to wear a watch.

07:50.070 --> 07:51.720
It's not allowed to wear a watch, either?

07:51.720 --> 07:52.350
Gosh.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.980
I didn't say you couldn't wear it.

07:55.390 --> 07:56.310
Look how nervous I am.

07:56.310 --> 07:57.820
People might think I'm taking the exam.

07:57.820 --> 07:58.870
What's wrong with your hand?

07:58.870 --> 07:59.510
I-I-It's fine.

07:59.510 --> 08:00.800
The skin is just peeling, isn't it?

08:00.800 --> 08:02.220
Didn't you tell me to sunbathe?

08:02.220 --> 08:03.160
It was caused by the sunbath.

08:03.160 --> 08:03.870
When did it happen?

08:03.870 --> 08:04.510
J-Just yesterday.

08:04.510 --> 08:06.630
Didn't I just go sunbathing yesterday?

08:06.630 --> 08:07.310
Wait for me.

08:07.310 --> 08:08.590
Hurry up.

08:08.680 --> 08:10.240
Only after I escort you there
can I feel relieved.

08:10.240 --> 08:12.000
Walk slowly when you go down the stairs.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.430
Hurry up!

08:14.510 --> 08:16.240
It's a call from the school.

08:16.240 --> 08:18.510
They said he didn't attend
t-the college entrance exam.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.170
Where is he?

08:19.390 --> 08:20.040
I've asked around.

08:20.040 --> 08:22.120
He bought a flight ticket to go abroad.

08:22.120 --> 08:24.160
He should be boarding soon.

08:25.660 --> 08:27.000
Put his mother's house

08:27.000 --> 08:27.660
up for sale.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.310
Then update him on the news.

08:29.690 --> 08:30.200
Got it.

08:32.970 --> 08:34.510
[National College Entrance Examination]

08:34.530 --> 08:35.440
[May You Succeed
in the College Entrance Exam!]

08:37.380 --> 08:37.890
[Good Luck
with the College Entrance Exam!]

08:38.809 --> 08:39.549
[College Entrance Exam, We're Coming!]

08:39.630 --> 08:41.010
[2016
National College Entrance Examination]

08:41.030 --> 08:41.750
[Pingchuan Experimental High School
Test Center]

08:46.210 --> 08:48.670
There are quite many people
wearing Qipaos.

08:49.140 --> 08:51.160
-Yeah.
-Obviously...

08:51.270 --> 08:53.220
They all want good luck

08:53.240 --> 08:54.610
and a successful start.

08:55.680 --> 08:56.920
Why didn't I think of

08:57.000 --> 08:58.030
wearing a Qipao?

09:01.000 --> 09:02.320
If one prepares well before the exam,

09:02.320 --> 09:04.320
he can evem take the exam in pajamas.

09:04.450 --> 09:06.450
You're always such a eloquent girl.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.470
Now that there are not many people here,

09:09.470 --> 09:10.750
go inside at once.

09:11.550 --> 09:12.840
Your forehead is covered with sweat.

09:12.840 --> 09:13.670
Don't wait for me.

09:13.670 --> 09:14.840
Go home now, okay?

09:14.840 --> 09:15.720
Alright.

09:15.740 --> 09:17.270
Do you want me to pick you up?

09:17.800 --> 09:18.480
If you want to

09:18.480 --> 09:19.600
change into a Qipao to pick me up,

09:19.600 --> 09:20.510
that's okay, too.

09:20.510 --> 09:21.000
Go!

09:21.080 --> 09:21.880
-Bye bye.
-Good luck.

09:21.880 --> 09:22.720
I'm leaving.

09:23.010 --> 09:23.940
Stay safe.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.720
[No Honking in the Test Center Area]

09:24.090 --> 09:25.020
Bye bye!

09:25.230 --> 09:26.020
Don't be nervous.

09:25.660 --> 09:27.440
[Rules for Candidates]

09:26.110 --> 09:26.910
Good luck!

09:27.600 --> 09:32.250
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Departures]

09:42.820 --> 09:50.720
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Departures]

09:56.180 --> 09:56.780
Hello.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.930
[Rules for Candidates]

09:58.630 --> 09:59.060
Okay.

09:59.730 --> 10:00.990
Come this way, please.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.240
Go inside.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.270
Ma'am, are you okay? Ma'am!

10:06.270 --> 10:07.070
Ma'am! Ma'am!

10:07.250 --> 10:08.510
-Ma'am!
-Are you okay?

10:09.150 --> 10:09.670
Okay.

10:10.960 --> 10:11.870
-What's wrong?
-Be careful.

10:11.870 --> 10:12.870
-What's wrong?
-Ma'am.

10:12.870 --> 10:13.630
Ma'am, are you okay?

10:13.630 --> 10:15.000
-What's wrong, Ma'am?
-Ma'am.

10:15.000 --> 10:16.180
What's wrong?

10:16.600 --> 10:17.200
Grandma!

10:17.750 --> 10:19.190
[Rules for Candidates]

10:19.260 --> 10:19.690
[Candidate Waiting Area]

10:19.640 --> 10:20.310
Grandma!

10:21.600 --> 10:22.200
Grandma!

10:22.200 --> 10:23.200
Someone fainted.

10:30.290 --> 10:33.230
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Departures]

10:33.250 --> 10:36.320
[In Surgery]

10:50.610 --> 10:51.270
Xixiao.

10:51.300 --> 10:53.210
Lu Zhongyue
wants to sell your mom's house.

10:53.210 --> 10:54.140
Do you know that?

10:54.270 --> 10:59.540
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Departures]

11:13.690 --> 11:16.080
[In Surgery]

11:18.840 --> 11:22.100
[Discussion Room]

11:20.920 --> 11:23.220
Dr. Chen, how is my grandma?

11:23.970 --> 11:25.300
She's out of danger now.

11:25.470 --> 11:26.290
But after the surgery, she still

11:26.290 --> 11:29.690
needs to stay in the hospital
for observation and treatment.

11:31.370 --> 11:34.650
[Discussion Room]

11:32.160 --> 11:34.210
Why did she suddenly have a heart attack?

11:34.210 --> 11:35.150
Diabetic patients

11:35.150 --> 11:36.510
actually have a higher incidence

11:36.510 --> 11:37.870
of cardiovascular diseases.

11:37.870 --> 11:39.610
What's more, your grandma is old now

11:39.610 --> 11:41.270
with several complications,

11:41.290 --> 11:42.950
and uremia is just one of them.

11:44.430 --> 11:45.640
But don't worry.

11:45.870 --> 11:46.550
Trust us

11:46.550 --> 11:48.410
as we will do our best to treat her.

11:48.450 --> 11:49.050
How about this?

11:49.050 --> 11:50.920
I'll go give the nurses
some instructions first.

11:50.920 --> 11:51.870
I'll talk to you later

11:51.870 --> 11:53.680
about the postoperative recovery.

11:53.680 --> 11:55.280
Thank you for your hard work.

11:55.370 --> 11:56.170
Oh, by the way,

11:56.470 --> 11:58.200
what about your exam tomorrow?

12:01.100 --> 12:01.760
It's fine.

12:02.020 --> 12:03.620
I'll take the exam next year.

12:06.000 --> 12:07.150
I'll go home and pack some clothes

12:07.150 --> 12:08.410
for her to change into.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.980
I'll be here early tomorrow morning.

13:09.560 --> 13:12.230
[Admission Ticket]

13:17.750 --> 13:19.360
[Admission Ticket]

13:20.810 --> 13:25.790
[Admission Ticket]

14:14.200 --> 14:16.600
No need to move all the four paintings.

14:18.270 --> 14:19.870
Regarding the Four Seasons series,

14:19.870 --> 14:21.360
j-just move that

14:21.360 --> 14:22.440
s-s-summer one.

14:29.270 --> 14:30.440
Not this one.

14:30.510 --> 14:32.000
I-It's that one.

14:33.670 --> 14:35.790
The one with the woman in a red dress
and the white horse.

14:35.790 --> 14:36.870
The one painted in

14:36.870 --> 14:38.330
r-r-red and green colors.

14:39.390 --> 14:40.360
Keep it down.

14:40.480 --> 14:42.480
Hurry! Hurry up!

14:46.170 --> 14:48.620
Watch your steps. W-Watch...

14:48.850 --> 14:49.630
What are you doing?

14:49.630 --> 14:50.510
No, Xixiao!

14:50.510 --> 14:51.720
Xixiao, this is Mr. Lu's idea.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.600
-Get up!
-No!

14:52.600 --> 14:53.960
We have an event these few days

14:53.960 --> 14:54.910
and need to use that painting.

14:54.910 --> 14:55.600
Well, Xixiao...

14:55.600 --> 14:56.910
Don't be impulsive!

14:57.000 --> 14:57.790
Don't worry.

14:57.790 --> 14:59.390
We'll return it when we finish using it.

14:59.390 --> 15:00.000
W-We're leaving.

15:00.000 --> 15:00.830
Go... Go get some rest.

15:00.830 --> 15:01.870
Go get some rest.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.830
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

15:08.600 --> 15:11.690
♪ But what's the point
of questioning and leaving? ♪

15:15.710 --> 15:18.060
♪ Naiveness is always used
in the wrong place ♪

15:21.170 --> 15:23.970
♪ Sadly, I didn't notice anything ♪

15:31.720 --> 15:33.280
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

15:34.580 --> 15:36.220
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

15:44.260 --> 15:45.750
♪ Your silent answer ♪

15:47.260 --> 15:51.600
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

15:52.740 --> 15:54.520
♪ Me and myself ♪

15:56.320 --> 15:57.770
♪ The unsettled self ♪

15:59.100 --> 16:00.780
♪ Dancing at night ♪

16:00.930 --> 16:03.630
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

16:05.190 --> 16:06.920
♪ Looking at myself ♪

16:08.370 --> 16:10.140
♪ With those traces of being teased ♪

16:11.200 --> 16:16.040
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

16:11.600 --> 16:16.710
[Wish You Success in the Exam
with a New Start and a Promising Future!]

16:17.650 --> 16:19.270
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

16:23.740 --> 16:25.580
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

16:29.720 --> 16:31.500
♪ Me and myself ♪

16:33.180 --> 16:34.520
♪ The unsettled self ♪

16:34.230 --> 16:37.030
[Wish You Success in the Exam
with a New Start and a Promising Future!]

16:36.080 --> 16:37.760
♪ Dancing at night ♪

16:37.910 --> 16:40.610
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

16:42.110 --> 16:43.740
♪ Looking at myself ♪

16:45.240 --> 16:50.070
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

16:51.690 --> 16:53.300
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

16:57.770 --> 16:59.740
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

17:02.640 --> 17:05.970
♪ I'm the only one left to heal myself ♪

17:12.260 --> 17:13.109
[Urgent Sale: A Villa in Shanhai Huafu]

17:13.119 --> 17:14.109
[Located on a sunny slope,
with a south-facing layout]

17:14.290 --> 17:16.550
Your dad's tactic is really despicable.

17:16.900 --> 17:17.960
He put your mom's old house

17:17.960 --> 17:18.619
up for sale.

17:19.160 --> 17:20.740
Alright. It's your misjudgment, too.

17:20.740 --> 17:22.069
You should just stay there
for a few more days.

17:22.069 --> 17:22.920
If a student
doesn't take the college entrance exam,

17:22.920 --> 17:24.020
his family will definitely be notified.

17:24.020 --> 17:24.960
Don't you know that?

17:24.960 --> 17:26.200
I'll live there from now on.

17:26.200 --> 17:26.920
I've changed the lock, too.

17:26.920 --> 17:27.510
I'd like to see who dares to sell it

17:27.510 --> 17:28.270
or go inside.

17:28.640 --> 17:29.200
Let me tell you.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.530
If you keep hiding,
it isn't a good solution.

17:30.530 --> 17:31.030
In my opinion,

17:31.030 --> 17:31.830
you should talk to your dad properly.

17:31.830 --> 17:32.400
In your opinion...

17:32.400 --> 17:34.930
Can you just
stop talking about your opinion?

17:37.350 --> 17:37.880
Ping.

17:38.510 --> 17:39.740
You've hired a new clerk, haven't you?

17:39.740 --> 17:40.370
Where is she?

17:40.370 --> 17:41.270
Right! She's in that room.

17:41.270 --> 17:42.590
I've told her to practice first.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.790
She's also from your school.

17:43.790 --> 17:44.840
I think you know each other.

17:44.840 --> 17:45.700
She's my niece.

17:46.240 --> 17:48.150
There are so many people in our school.

17:48.150 --> 17:49.400
There aren't many of them I truly know.

17:49.400 --> 17:50.400
Not necessarily.

17:51.130 --> 17:52.270
The top scorer
of the college entrance exam in our city

17:52.270 --> 17:53.640
is also from your school.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.500
-His name is Zhou...
-Zhou Jiayi.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.050
He always ranked third.

17:57.110 --> 17:58.440
That's right. His score is 705 points.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.310
Very impressive.

17:59.310 --> 18:00.510
Why isn't it Zhou Wan?

18:00.920 --> 18:02.310
Why are you still thinking about her?

18:02.310 --> 18:05.100
She must have messed up her exam
as soon as you left.

18:05.100 --> 18:06.530
I asked for an imported steering damper.

18:06.530 --> 18:08.140
What kind of garbage did you give me?

18:08.140 --> 18:09.680
Why didn't you say so just now?

18:09.680 --> 18:10.680
Why did you wait
till you finished trying it?

18:10.680 --> 18:11.510
How would I know if I didn't try it?

18:11.510 --> 18:12.680
Are you finding fault with me on purpose?

18:12.680 --> 18:13.310
Are you making trouble?

18:13.310 --> 18:14.310
It's a problem
about your service attitude.

18:14.310 --> 18:15.270
Stop!

18:15.960 --> 18:16.640
What's wrong?

18:16.640 --> 18:17.510
She gave me the wrong component.

18:17.510 --> 18:18.550
What do you think is the problem?

18:18.550 --> 18:19.350
Gu Meng?

18:19.440 --> 18:20.110
Why are you here?

18:20.110 --> 18:20.400
See?

18:20.400 --> 18:21.560
I said you two knew each other.

18:21.560 --> 18:22.310
So she's your niece?

18:22.310 --> 18:23.250
Yeah.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.720
My issue hasn't been solved yet.

18:25.760 --> 18:26.510
I'll find... find another one for you.

18:26.510 --> 18:27.480
Steering damper!

18:27.480 --> 18:28.920
Do you know a lot
about fixing motorcycles?

18:28.920 --> 18:30.340
-Don't argue with him.
-It's none of your business.

18:30.340 --> 18:32.330
I remember
your family runs real estate business.

18:32.330 --> 18:33.510
-When did you change to fix motorcycles?
-What do you know?

18:33.510 --> 18:34.790
What are you showing off for?

18:34.790 --> 18:35.980
I'm a customer.

18:36.030 --> 18:36.830
Stop arguing.

18:36.960 --> 18:37.830
Why are you making trouble here?

18:37.830 --> 18:38.790
-Xixiao!
-What's your purpose?

18:38.790 --> 18:40.720
Xixiao, Xixiao, Xixiao.

18:41.130 --> 18:42.040
It's you again.

18:43.090 --> 18:43.880
I was wondering why this motorcycle

18:43.880 --> 18:45.400
looked so familiar.

18:47.050 --> 18:49.530
Honestly,
your motorcycle is quite nice indeed.

18:49.530 --> 18:50.500
This whole...

18:50.530 --> 18:51.830
Did I let you touch my motorcycle?

18:51.830 --> 18:53.070
S-S-S-Stop arguing.

18:53.070 --> 18:54.200
Did I let you touch it?

18:54.200 --> 18:54.790
Xixiao!

18:56.350 --> 18:57.180
I know you.

18:57.510 --> 18:59.750
Lu Zhongyue's son, Lu Xixiao.

19:00.160 --> 19:02.240
Even your dad has to beg my family.

19:04.090 --> 19:05.890
What does that have to do with me?

19:06.480 --> 19:07.640
Since you're so defiant,

19:07.640 --> 19:09.800
and we both have the hobby
of riding motorcycles,

19:09.800 --> 19:11.460
do you dare to race against me?

19:11.680 --> 19:12.680
If you win,

19:12.680 --> 19:14.140
I'll smash my motorcycle.

19:14.640 --> 19:16.030
But if you lose,

19:17.400 --> 19:19.040
you'll have to kneel down
and apologize to me.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.840
Do you dare, Lu Xixiao?

19:24.200 --> 19:25.680
Good luck!

19:25.610 --> 19:26.980
[Pingchuan Station, Starting Line]

19:25.790 --> 19:27.180
Lu Xixiao, good luck!

19:27.050 --> 19:30.440
[Racing Cup,
Pingchuan Station, Starting Line]

19:27.350 --> 19:28.270
Good luck!

19:28.440 --> 19:30.300
-Good luck!
-You must defeat him!

19:31.960 --> 19:32.810
Xixiao.

19:33.060 --> 19:34.060
I know you can win.

19:34.090 --> 19:35.820
But you should still stay safe.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.670
Good luck! Good luck!

19:41.190 --> 19:41.990
Lu Xixiao.

19:42.730 --> 19:44.130
Have you figured out
how you're going to lose?

19:44.130 --> 19:45.480
Stop pretending.

19:45.510 --> 19:47.060
You'll have to kneel if you lose.

19:47.060 --> 19:48.320
What a brat.

19:52.510 --> 19:53.400
Good luck!

19:55.560 --> 19:56.360
Good luck!

20:10.210 --> 20:12.420
[Racing Cup, Pingchuan Station]

20:23.870 --> 20:27.260
[Racing Cup, Pingchuan Station]

20:29.640 --> 20:32.000
Lu Xixiao, good luck!

20:41.780 --> 20:43.870
Why can He Wenhui ride so fast?

20:44.300 --> 20:45.960
After He Wenhui's motorcycle was refitted,

20:45.960 --> 20:47.510
its performance became really good.

20:47.510 --> 20:48.710
In the first section,

20:48.750 --> 20:49.750
Xixiao might be at a disadvantage.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.920
Then he's doomed.

20:50.990 --> 20:51.900
Of course not.

20:51.980 --> 20:53.490
Though the components are not good enough,
his skills can make up for it.

20:53.490 --> 20:54.760
I'm sure Xixiao can do this.

20:54.760 --> 20:55.640
I just took a look at

20:55.640 --> 20:56.440
He Wenhui's motorcycle.

20:56.440 --> 20:57.480
All its components have been

20:57.480 --> 20:59.090
replaced with the latest imported models.

20:59.090 --> 21:00.310
All the motorcycle repair shops
in Pingchuan

21:00.310 --> 21:01.030
couldn't even gather those components,

21:01.030 --> 21:02.350
let alone using them on one motorcycle.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.160
That costs a lot of money.

21:03.160 --> 21:04.160
Then what's the point of having a race?

21:04.160 --> 21:05.400
Just give him the "Filthy Rich Man" award.

21:05.400 --> 21:07.000
Racing isn't that simple.

21:07.020 --> 21:07.960
Xixiao's motorcycle has also

21:07.960 --> 21:09.400
been tuned by himself bit by bit.

21:09.400 --> 21:10.240
This haphazardly assembled motorcycle

21:10.240 --> 21:11.310
is no match for his.

21:11.330 --> 21:11.830
What's more,

21:11.830 --> 21:12.640
Xixiao's racing skills

21:12.640 --> 21:13.110
are also better than his.

21:13.110 --> 21:13.640
That's right.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.510
After watching it for a while, we'll know

21:14.510 --> 21:15.980
He Wenhui's true ability.

21:16.000 --> 21:18.130
Xixiao has passed through the bridge.

21:18.270 --> 21:19.880
Next, there will be a long straightaway.

21:19.880 --> 21:20.680
On this straightaway,

21:20.680 --> 21:21.680
He Wenhui can utilize

21:21.680 --> 21:22.920
his maximum performance advantage.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.880
An advantage again?

21:23.880 --> 21:25.460
Uncle, can't you say something positive?

21:25.460 --> 21:26.180
Calm down.

21:26.210 --> 21:26.960
When they passed through
the bridge just now,

21:26.960 --> 21:27.750
I observed it carefully.

21:27.750 --> 21:28.960
He Wenhui's cornering skills

21:28.960 --> 21:30.270
are far inferior to Xixiao's.

21:30.270 --> 21:31.550
As long as Xixiao firmly keeps up

21:31.550 --> 21:32.900
with He Wenhui on the straightaway,

21:32.900 --> 21:34.490
he'll have a great chance later.

21:34.490 --> 21:35.510
After the long straightaway,

21:35.510 --> 21:36.590
it'll be the S-bend

21:36.590 --> 21:37.680
which Xixiao is best at.

21:37.680 --> 21:38.590
In this field, no one

21:38.590 --> 21:39.770
has ever been able to break his record.

21:39.770 --> 21:42.770
Xixiao is invincible
on this part of the racing track.

21:48.000 --> 21:50.820
-Come on, Lu Xixiao!
-He's going to overtake him.

21:51.680 --> 21:52.960
If I'm not mistaken,

21:52.960 --> 21:54.030
in the second lap,

21:54.030 --> 21:55.130
the gap between them
will narrow even more.

21:55.130 --> 21:56.090
Really?

21:56.110 --> 21:57.310
Xixiao has maintained
the motorcycle's performance

21:57.310 --> 21:58.200
very well.

21:58.220 --> 21:59.290
And his handling of the cornering lines

21:59.290 --> 22:00.260
is more accurate.

22:00.260 --> 22:01.160
He will slowly narrow

22:01.160 --> 22:02.090
the previous gap

22:02.210 --> 22:03.990
and then wait for a chance
to overtake He Wenhui.

22:03.990 --> 22:05.980
The longer it takes,
the better it'll be for him.

22:05.980 --> 22:07.940
Look! Lu Xixiao is only a little bit

22:07.960 --> 22:09.760
behind him on the straightaway.

22:13.840 --> 22:14.690
He's playing dirty tricks!

22:14.690 --> 22:15.400
You can't afford to lose, huh?

22:15.400 --> 22:15.920
How shameless!

22:15.920 --> 22:16.680
What He Wenhui just did

22:16.680 --> 22:17.550
was definitely deliberate.

22:17.550 --> 22:18.480
If Xixiao hadn't reacted quickly,

22:18.480 --> 22:19.000
he would have crashed.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.240
Come on, Lu Xixiao!

22:20.240 --> 22:21.070
Don't lose to

22:21.070 --> 22:22.440
that poser who plays dirty tricks!

22:22.440 --> 22:23.110
Don't worry.

22:23.110 --> 22:24.160
On the bend, Lu Xixiao

22:24.160 --> 22:25.130
can still narrow the gap.

22:25.130 --> 22:26.240
Look! I told you so!

22:26.240 --> 22:27.030
The gap between Xixiao and him

22:27.030 --> 22:28.160
has narrowed again.

22:28.880 --> 22:30.110
I was right, huh?

22:30.310 --> 22:31.160
Come on!

22:31.640 --> 22:33.030
Though He Wenhui's motorcycle is fast,

22:33.030 --> 22:33.510
his own

22:33.510 --> 22:34.720
aggressive driving style

22:34.720 --> 22:36.520
is too rough for the motorcycle.

22:36.750 --> 22:37.720
His cornering speed

22:37.720 --> 22:38.720
will get slower and slower

22:38.720 --> 22:39.780
as the race goes on.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.000
Lu Xixiao won't let go

22:41.000 --> 22:42.200
of this opportunity.

22:42.200 --> 22:43.000
On the S-bend,

22:43.000 --> 22:44.600
he will narrow the gap again.

22:44.650 --> 22:47.450
In the end, he'll wait for a chance
to overtake him.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.310
The gap between them is very small.

22:57.310 --> 22:58.270
Xixiao has done very well

22:58.270 --> 22:59.530
on the straightaways.

23:01.060 --> 23:02.510
[Finishing Line]

23:01.270 --> 23:02.270
Whether Xixiao can win

23:02.270 --> 23:03.110
depends on the last bend

23:03.110 --> 23:04.040
of the third lap,

23:04.150 --> 23:05.280
which is right here.

23:08.720 --> 23:09.610
They're coming.

23:09.610 --> 23:10.580
This very bend of the last lap!

23:10.580 --> 23:12.380
This bend is the most important!

23:30.550 --> 23:31.350
Xixiao!

23:33.070 --> 23:33.880
He won!

23:34.350 --> 23:35.030
He won!

23:35.450 --> 23:35.890
He won!

23:35.920 --> 23:36.440
He won!

23:35.960 --> 23:36.810
[Finishing Line]

23:38.610 --> 23:39.900
[Racing Cup, Pingchuan Station]

23:45.200 --> 23:45.790
He won!

23:46.200 --> 23:47.160
He won!

23:47.960 --> 23:49.080
Awesome!

23:49.110 --> 23:50.110
So great!

23:51.750 --> 23:53.500
Amazing!

23:54.080 --> 23:56.190
[A Sure Win]

23:54.240 --> 23:55.090
Just some basic operations.

23:55.090 --> 23:56.620
He was just lucky this time.

23:58.850 --> 24:00.400
Admit defeat and keep your promise!

24:00.400 --> 24:02.100
Someone is going to kneel.

24:03.720 --> 24:05.940
Lu Xixiao! You played dirty tricks, huh?

24:05.940 --> 24:07.260
-Who played dirty tricks?
-What?

24:07.260 --> 24:08.890
You can't afford to lose, huh?

24:08.890 --> 24:09.510
Will you do it yourself

24:09.510 --> 24:10.440
or should we help you?

24:10.440 --> 24:11.640
Who dares to touch it?

24:12.240 --> 24:13.120
Ping!

24:17.200 --> 24:18.030
Lu Xixiao!

24:18.310 --> 24:19.970
You can't afford to lose, huh?

24:20.600 --> 24:23.860
If you can't afford to lose,
don't come out to play anymore.

24:24.670 --> 24:25.470
Let's go!

24:26.550 --> 24:27.830
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

24:27.830 --> 24:28.840
What a sore loser.

24:30.800 --> 24:31.720
So what if you're rich?

24:31.720 --> 24:32.750
He defeated you.

24:32.770 --> 24:33.880
So what if you're rich?

24:33.880 --> 24:35.030
Lu Xixiao.

24:35.050 --> 24:36.410
How about coming to our shop?

24:36.410 --> 24:37.200
Just wait and see.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.860
I can even give you a discount.

24:41.920 --> 24:42.870
She's coming.

24:47.410 --> 24:50.100
Little liar.

24:53.820 --> 24:54.960
Oh, she has quite a temper.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.220
She has quite a temper.

24:58.030 --> 24:58.640
I thought

24:58.640 --> 24:59.830
we'd have a top scorer

24:59.830 --> 25:01.480
among our tenants.

25:03.070 --> 25:05.290
-But you didn't even enter the test center.
-If I become the top scorer,

25:05.290 --> 25:07.350
will you stop coming to collect rent?

25:07.630 --> 25:08.560
Of course not.

25:08.580 --> 25:09.880
I can't make things difficult for myself

25:09.880 --> 25:12.080
just because you're having a hard time.

25:12.810 --> 25:14.790
It's time to pay the rent. Pay up.

25:15.300 --> 25:16.890
Didn't I pay it last time?

25:16.920 --> 25:18.160
Last time was last time.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.400
This time is this time.

25:19.400 --> 25:20.110
That's right.

25:20.110 --> 25:20.720
Besides,

25:20.740 --> 25:21.640
if you don't pay us the rent,

25:21.640 --> 25:22.740
what will we eat and use?

25:22.740 --> 25:23.900
Hurry up. Give us the money.

25:23.900 --> 25:24.550
Give us the money.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.550
Give us the money.

25:26.300 --> 25:27.170
Really?

25:28.030 --> 25:29.540
I can also go ask your boss

25:29.640 --> 25:31.050
what exactly is going on.

25:35.220 --> 25:36.550
Are you threatening me?

25:39.260 --> 25:41.460
Fine. I can't explain it clearly to you.

25:42.370 --> 25:43.260
Fen knows it.

25:43.290 --> 25:44.350
I'll go talk to Fen.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.700
You're such a drag.

25:59.260 --> 26:00.530
Hello, Wenhui.

26:00.930 --> 26:02.530
What are your instructions?

26:05.150 --> 26:06.000
Lu Xixiao?

26:06.640 --> 26:07.640
Keep an eye on her.

26:07.810 --> 26:09.340
What's wrong? You and he...

26:14.340 --> 26:16.000
Alright. I'll be right there.

26:21.880 --> 26:23.960
This isn't over.

26:53.420 --> 26:54.010
Brat.

26:55.880 --> 26:57.510
You messed with the wrong person.

26:57.510 --> 26:58.500
I'm sorry,

26:58.840 --> 27:00.240
but I was asked to do this.

27:01.100 --> 27:02.450
Speaking of He Wenhui,

27:02.610 --> 27:04.670
this is all that he's capable of, huh?

27:21.360 --> 27:22.370
How stubborn.

27:23.730 --> 27:24.980
I like tough guys.

27:36.250 --> 27:36.770
Hit him.

28:24.350 --> 28:26.350
That's right. Thanks for your help.

28:26.510 --> 28:27.200
Please come as soon as possible.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.660
Okay. We'll go there right away.

28:28.660 --> 28:30.390
Please ensure your own safety.

28:33.320 --> 28:34.430
Wan!

28:35.070 --> 28:35.790
Wan!

28:35.810 --> 28:36.630
Where are you going?

28:36.630 --> 28:37.590
Get on quickly. I'll take you there.

28:37.590 --> 28:38.070
Meng,

28:38.150 --> 28:39.350
lend me your scooter.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.350
Y-You'll ride it?

28:40.350 --> 28:41.650
Yes, I'll ride it.

28:42.310 --> 28:42.920
Thanks.

28:43.330 --> 28:45.000
B-B-Be careful.

28:45.140 --> 28:47.340
Be careful not to break my scooter, too.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.280
Take him away.

29:07.530 --> 29:08.330
Stop her!

29:08.640 --> 29:09.390
Stop her now!

29:09.460 --> 29:10.190
Stop her now!

29:11.200 --> 29:12.000
Get on!

29:12.780 --> 29:15.080
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

29:15.120 --> 29:16.870
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

29:16.920 --> 29:19.460
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

29:21.090 --> 29:23.080
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

29:23.160 --> 29:26.550
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

29:28.490 --> 29:30.180
♪ In this boring universe ♪

29:30.200 --> 29:31.750
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

29:32.040 --> 29:35.970
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

29:36.050 --> 29:37.540
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

29:38.810 --> 29:41.820
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

29:38.970 --> 29:40.110
Hurry! The police are coming.

29:40.110 --> 29:41.210
Zhou Wan?

29:42.340 --> 29:43.070
Let's go.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.160
The police... The police are coming!

29:43.690 --> 29:46.280
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

29:44.190 --> 29:46.120
Bro, hurry up! Let's go!

30:10.530 --> 30:11.790
Turn your face around.

30:23.660 --> 30:26.320
Let me give your wound
a simple treatment first.

30:29.570 --> 30:31.370
You'd better go to the hospital.

30:33.130 --> 30:34.810
Don't get the wound wet,

30:34.920 --> 30:36.650
or it will get inflamed easily.

30:40.640 --> 30:41.960
Alright. That's almost done, huh?

30:41.960 --> 30:45.020
This isn't fully attached to your wound.
Wait a moment.

31:13.570 --> 31:15.370
Then I'll... I'll get going now.

31:17.280 --> 31:18.540
The noodles are ready!

31:19.740 --> 31:20.440
The noodles are ready.

31:20.440 --> 31:22.970
Why don't you have some noodles
before you go?

31:25.810 --> 31:27.240
I don't want to owe anyone favors.

31:27.240 --> 31:28.240
This meal is on me.

31:28.260 --> 31:28.910
Let's go.

31:46.440 --> 31:47.370
-You...
-You...

31:51.930 --> 31:53.060
You can speak first.

31:57.500 --> 31:59.430
Didn't you pass the language test?

31:59.680 --> 32:00.730
Why didn't you go?

32:07.360 --> 32:09.220
Then let me ask another question.

32:09.890 --> 32:11.420
Why did you get into a fight?

32:14.090 --> 32:16.290
Because they were looking for trouble.

32:21.930 --> 32:24.130
If you don't believe it, just forget it.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.720
Does it matter if I believe it or not?

32:30.700 --> 32:31.510
Zhou Wan.

32:34.620 --> 32:35.920
You were the one who offered to

32:35.920 --> 32:37.050
be my tutor at first.

32:38.350 --> 32:39.350
And now you're the one who has been

32:39.350 --> 32:40.950
hiding from me for no reason.

32:41.480 --> 32:42.510
If you really don't want to

32:42.510 --> 32:43.970
get involved in my matters

32:44.000 --> 32:45.660
or have anything to do with me,

32:46.010 --> 32:47.410
why did you get to know me?

32:52.240 --> 32:53.200
Not everyone can

32:53.200 --> 32:54.480
live as they please.

32:54.990 --> 32:56.070
And not everyone can

32:56.070 --> 32:57.330
do whatever they want.

33:01.170 --> 33:03.030
Today, I just happened to see you.

33:03.680 --> 33:04.880
I was being nosy.

33:05.990 --> 33:07.250
Don't take it to heart.

33:07.780 --> 33:09.380
I didn't mean anything else.

33:16.250 --> 33:19.140
♪ I will keep this frozen heart ♪

33:20.110 --> 33:21.960
♪ I think someone will accept it ♪

33:22.570 --> 33:25.410
♪ In my broken heart ♪

33:22.620 --> 33:24.220
Even if it was a coincidence,

33:25.710 --> 33:26.840
can't you regard it

33:26.880 --> 33:27.780
as fate?

33:26.980 --> 33:28.610
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

33:30.370 --> 33:33.480
♪ It's just that I'm unforgivable ♪

33:34.430 --> 33:37.680
♪ Self-reflection in your heart ♪

33:39.650 --> 33:41.050
♪ Being ignorant doesn't mean ♪

33:41.080 --> 33:42.730
♪ I can do whatever I want ♪

33:45.180 --> 33:47.960
♪ I seem to have never ♪

33:48.000 --> 33:49.250
♪ Closed the sunroof ♪

33:51.980 --> 33:53.470
♪ Telling you how the sky above the roof ♪

33:53.490 --> 33:54.650
♪ Is full of stars ♪

33:59.910 --> 34:05.700
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

34:00.570 --> 34:01.380
Meng.

34:01.410 --> 34:02.310
I'm here to return the scooter.

34:02.310 --> 34:03.030
Wan.

34:03.390 --> 34:04.240
Don't worry.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.510
The police have taken them away
for interrogation.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.000
Those several hooligans

34:06.000 --> 34:07.330
have all been arrested.

34:13.090 --> 34:14.550
It's good that we are safe.

34:14.850 --> 34:16.909
I'll thank you properly another day.

34:17.000 --> 34:17.929
I'm leaving now.

34:18.070 --> 34:19.400
You're leaving so soon?

34:23.620 --> 34:24.270
Bye bye.

34:25.239 --> 34:25.980
Gu Meng.

34:26.710 --> 34:28.380
Thank you for lending her the scooter.

34:28.380 --> 34:29.290
Don't mention it.

34:29.290 --> 34:29.949
I'm glad I could help.

34:29.949 --> 34:31.350
What's going on between them?

34:31.350 --> 34:32.880
It's none of your business.

34:37.510 --> 34:38.460
This isn't a water tank.

34:38.460 --> 34:40.120
Why are you adding water to it?

34:42.449 --> 34:43.710
Who did you fight with?

34:44.920 --> 34:46.270
I just bumped into something.

34:46.270 --> 34:47.080
You bumped into something?

34:47.080 --> 34:48.880
Why do I find it so hard
to believe your words?

34:48.880 --> 34:50.510
Is it because of Miss Straight-A?

34:50.510 --> 34:51.510
You're blaming Zhou Wan again?

34:51.510 --> 34:52.800
Whenever something happens,
you always blame Zhou Wan.

34:52.800 --> 34:53.800
Something so serious
has happened in her family.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.330
She doesn't have time to...

34:56.590 --> 34:58.190
What happened in her family?

34:58.590 --> 34:59.230
Tell me.

35:00.520 --> 35:03.780
I also have no idea,
but her grandma is hospitalized and...

35:04.090 --> 35:04.700
What?

35:06.360 --> 35:07.290
What did she say?

35:07.550 --> 35:08.880
She said her grandma...

35:09.920 --> 35:11.320
She missed the college entrance exam
because her grandma was hospitalized.

35:11.320 --> 35:12.230
And she can't afford the medical bills.

35:12.230 --> 35:13.960
She's having quite a hard time.

35:14.890 --> 35:16.150
You can't even understand that?

35:16.150 --> 35:17.950
You could even understand that?

35:25.470 --> 35:29.150
[Reception Area
of Dialysis Treatment Room 1]

35:32.370 --> 35:34.350
Are you okay today? Does it hurt?

35:35.000 --> 35:35.930
It doesn't hurt.

35:36.320 --> 35:37.720
I'm just a little tired.

35:37.580 --> 35:44.710
[Reception Area
of Dialysis Treatment Room 1]

35:39.580 --> 35:40.240
Let me do it.

35:40.790 --> 35:41.270
Okay.

35:42.260 --> 35:43.320
The patient is old,

35:43.560 --> 35:44.920
so her recovery process
will be rather slow.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.530
Make sure she gets enough rest.

35:46.530 --> 35:47.090
Okay.

35:48.500 --> 35:49.750
As for today's bill,

35:49.870 --> 35:51.110
I'll go pay it.

35:51.210 --> 35:51.930
The bill?

35:52.200 --> 35:52.840
Didn't you

35:52.840 --> 35:54.040
already pay it today?

36:15.930 --> 36:17.190
I'll accept the drink,

36:17.250 --> 36:18.000
but I really can't let you

36:18.000 --> 36:19.600
pay the medical bills for me.

36:22.330 --> 36:23.730
I'm very grateful to you.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.920
I know this money

36:25.920 --> 36:27.850
might just be a small amount to you.

36:28.660 --> 36:30.140
But I'm an adult now.

36:30.590 --> 36:31.720
I'm an able-bodied person.

36:31.720 --> 36:33.230
I can make money by myself.

36:34.510 --> 36:36.490
I've already transferred it to you
on WeChat.

36:36.490 --> 36:37.550
You must accept it.

36:38.940 --> 36:40.070
When we were
at the noodle restaurant yesterday,

36:40.070 --> 36:41.330
why didn't you tell me?

36:42.300 --> 36:44.290
This is not some good news.

36:45.180 --> 36:46.580
Why would I talk about it?

36:48.270 --> 36:49.150
I transferred the money to you

36:49.150 --> 36:50.550
not because I pitied you.

36:50.760 --> 36:51.800
Previously,
when you offered to be my tutor,

36:51.800 --> 36:52.280
wasn't it also for

36:52.280 --> 36:53.570
your grandma's medical bills?

36:53.570 --> 36:55.000
-Now, isn't this a good way to...
-When I was your tutor,

36:55.000 --> 36:56.510
you and I had an employment relationship.

36:56.510 --> 36:57.400
S-S-So...

36:57.400 --> 36:58.630
I earned the money
to pay the medical bills.

36:58.630 --> 36:59.210
That was different.

36:59.210 --> 37:00.960
Now, as your friend,

37:01.320 --> 37:02.150
can I help you?

37:03.600 --> 37:04.800
Ma'am, give me an ice cream cone.

37:04.800 --> 37:05.240
Okay.

37:06.770 --> 37:07.630
Do you want one?

37:16.060 --> 37:16.580
Thanks.

37:19.650 --> 37:20.250
I'll pay.

37:20.670 --> 37:21.460
How much is it?

37:21.460 --> 37:22.200
Five yuan.

37:29.050 --> 37:29.570
Okay.

37:29.870 --> 37:30.470
Thank you.

37:33.510 --> 37:34.000
Thanks.

37:37.130 --> 37:42.800
[Heartbeat Player]

37:46.190 --> 37:47.650
Excuse me, are you hiring?

38:06.410 --> 38:08.590
Have you played this claw machine before?

38:08.590 --> 38:09.960
That claw machine has a mechanism.

38:09.960 --> 38:10.590
Two people already

38:10.590 --> 38:11.750
caught dolls from it this morning.

38:11.750 --> 38:12.360
I think it's very hard

38:12.360 --> 38:13.800
for you to catch one now.

38:15.120 --> 38:16.070
Then you probably haven't heard

38:16.070 --> 38:16.960
how good I am.

38:21.000 --> 38:23.260
I'm just afraid you'll waste your money.

38:32.820 --> 38:34.750
You're afraid I'll waste my money?

38:36.370 --> 38:39.450
But why do I feel this money

38:40.770 --> 38:41.810
was well spent?

38:44.390 --> 38:46.320
So you really managed to catch one?

38:50.290 --> 38:51.090
Do you like it?

38:52.850 --> 38:53.580
It's for you.

38:56.270 --> 38:57.870
It looks quite like you, too.

38:58.060 --> 39:00.340
I'm Zhou Wan.

39:00.360 --> 39:01.150
What?

39:00.620 --> 39:02.430
♪ Give me some candlelight ♪

39:01.150 --> 39:02.550
It's for you. Take it.

39:04.090 --> 39:05.850
♪ Let it illuminate his face ♪

39:07.190 --> 39:08.690
♪ if your voice is hoarse ♪

39:09.170 --> 39:10.460
This necklace...

39:09.520 --> 39:11.930
♪ It'll lead to more imaginations ♪

39:11.030 --> 39:11.760
It's for you.

39:13.780 --> 39:14.530
It's for me?

39:13.970 --> 39:15.520
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

39:16.350 --> 39:17.150
Let me ask you.

39:17.360 --> 39:19.410
♪ Has filled the corridor ♪

39:18.590 --> 39:19.790
Are we still friends?

39:20.710 --> 39:22.300
♪ Wet clothes ♪

39:23.360 --> 39:25.820
♪ Flowing waves ♪

39:27.450 --> 39:29.710
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

39:28.780 --> 39:30.440
This goes with my bow and arrow,

39:30.440 --> 39:32.160
doesn't it?

39:30.840 --> 39:33.070
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

39:33.960 --> 39:34.610
Is that so?

39:34.100 --> 39:35.820
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

39:36.310 --> 39:37.590
It's just a coincidence.

39:37.590 --> 39:39.820
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

39:40.910 --> 39:43.500
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

39:44.480 --> 39:46.580
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

39:44.850 --> 39:45.600
Enough.

39:46.110 --> 39:47.710
Don't ask so many questions.

39:48.050 --> 39:50.140
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

39:49.280 --> 39:50.480
I'll accept the necklace.

39:50.480 --> 39:51.230
But this Kobito is too ugly.

39:51.230 --> 39:52.570
-What?
-It doesn't look like me at all.

39:51.560 --> 39:53.190
♪ It's getting late ♪

39:52.860 --> 39:53.760
It looks quite like you.

39:53.760 --> 39:54.870
Take a look by yourself.

39:54.870 --> 39:56.160
It's like looking in a mirror.

39:54.900 --> 39:56.250
♪ His obsession ♪

40:12.960 --> 40:13.810
What's wrong?

40:16.770 --> 40:18.370
Someone broke into my house.

40:19.190 --> 40:20.190
Do you need help?

40:20.330 --> 40:21.860
Do you want me to go with you?

40:24.960 --> 40:25.690
Okay.

40:34.560 --> 40:36.360
This is the place I saw last time.

40:37.070 --> 40:38.330
This is my mom's house.

40:39.970 --> 40:40.660
Mr. Li.

40:40.690 --> 40:41.860
I guarantee

40:41.890 --> 40:43.550
you'll absolutely be satisfied
after seeing this house.

40:43.550 --> 40:44.230
There are many other people

40:44.230 --> 40:45.880
who are on the waiting list
to see this house.

40:45.880 --> 40:46.800
The owner
is already waiting for you inside.

40:46.800 --> 40:47.480
Who is this?

40:47.550 --> 40:48.240
Mrs. Lu!

40:49.110 --> 40:49.710
Mrs. Lu!

40:51.000 --> 40:52.150
Mr. Li is here to see the house.

40:52.150 --> 40:53.070
Hello. Come in.

40:53.070 --> 40:53.850
Be careful.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.510
Thanks for your hard work, Li.

40:55.510 --> 40:56.320
It's my duty.

40:56.320 --> 40:57.040
Come in.

41:06.270 --> 41:07.730
Are you selling the house?

41:08.280 --> 41:09.740
It won't be sold. Let's go.

41:12.000 --> 41:12.940
Don't be impulsive.

41:12.940 --> 41:14.870
We'll run into them if we go inside.

41:14.960 --> 41:16.220
Then what should we do?

41:16.360 --> 41:18.090
Are there any other entrances?

41:18.930 --> 41:20.130
Over there. Let's go.

41:22.470 --> 41:24.030
Mr. Li, this way, please.

41:26.680 --> 41:28.050
The area of this house

41:28.190 --> 41:29.320
is about

41:29.320 --> 41:30.850
580 square meters in total.

41:30.880 --> 41:31.880
What's your plan?

41:32.620 --> 41:34.390
I haven't come up with a plan yet.

41:34.390 --> 41:35.280
Well, didn't you confidently say

41:35.280 --> 41:36.050
that you had a plan?

41:36.050 --> 41:37.650
This is your house, not mine.

41:37.660 --> 41:39.280
I'm looking right now, aren't I?

41:39.280 --> 41:40.070
If you like anything,

41:40.070 --> 41:40.960
you can keep it.

41:42.090 --> 41:43.400
Cut the crap.

41:43.430 --> 41:44.920
Do you think I lack the money?

41:44.920 --> 41:45.750
You're right.

41:45.830 --> 41:46.610
Mr. Li,

41:46.630 --> 41:48.040
we are sincere.
